SAFE Agreement Update

Hi <%= @investor.name %>,

<% case @safe.status %>
<% when "sent" %>
Your SAFE agreement with <%= @account.name %> is ready for your signature.

Investment Amount: $<%= number_with_delimiter(@safe.investment_amount) %>
<% if @safe.valuation_cap %>
Valuation Cap: $<%= number_with_delimiter(@safe.valuation_cap) %>
<% end %>
<% if @safe.discount_percent %>
Discount: <%= @safe.discount_percent %>%
<% end %>
Type: <%= @safe.safe_type.titleize %> SAFE

Please review and sign your agreement at your earliest convenience.

<% when "signed" %>
Great news! Your SAFE agreement with <%= @account.name %> has been fully executed.

Investment Amount: $<%= number_with_delimiter(@safe.investment_amount) %>
Status: Signed on <%= @safe.signed_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>

Thank you for your investment. You can view your SAFE agreement in the investor portal.

<% when "converted" %>
Your SAFE agreement with <%= @account.name %> has converted to equity!

Original Investment: $<%= number_with_delimiter(@safe.investment_amount) %>
Shares Received: <%= number_with_delimiter(@safe.conversion_shares) %>
Price Per Share: $<%= number_with_precision(@safe.conversion_price_per_share, precision: 4) %>
Round: <%= @safe.conversion_round_name %>

Congratulations! You are now a shareholder in <%= @account.name %>.
<% end %>

View in Investor Portal: <%= @portal_url %>

Best regards,
The <%= @account.name %> Team
